{
  "server": "tw",
  "storyId": "main_6_level_main_06-07_end",
  "groupId": "main_6",
  "stageId": "main_06-07",
  "title": "只是從天而降！",
  "storyCode": "6-8",
  "avgTag": "行動後",
  "sourcePath": "vendor/ArknightsData/tw/gamedata/story/obt/main/level_main_06-07_end.txt",
  "sourceHash": "8a8f7c113319163a5db06d195e6c908ad14c4e8d36d67343e31f46dd5a267d3a",
  "bodyAvailable": true,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "第三关（后）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "煌",
      "text": "哈，哈......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米婭",
      "text": "煌！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "煌",
      "text": "我沒事！他們還......真有點本事。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "煌",
      "text": "沒被凍著吧？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米婭",
      "text": "讓區域內的空氣變熱阻絕她的寒流，也只有你能做到了。多虧了你，我們沒什麼損傷。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "煌",
      "text": "小意思。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "煌",
      "text": "用冰的，你怎麼不用致死性法術？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "霜星",
      "text": "咳，咳......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "煌",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "煌",
      "text": "原來如此。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米婭",
      "text": "......霜星她那個樣子......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "煌",
      "text": "霜星，是嗎？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "霜星",
      "text": "咳......幫我......遮一下......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雪怪小隊成員",
      "text": "大姊......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "煌",
      "text": "快走，阿米婭。路上可能還有其他的整合運動。有傷患嗎？我可以搭把手。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "霜星",
      "text": "想這樣就撤退？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "煌",
      "text": "我勸你一句。別再戰鬥了，白毛兔子。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "煌",
      "text": "再這麼強撐著用法術，你會死得很快。你的力量正在把你的活力榨乾。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "煌",
      "text": "或者，你可以來羅德島。至少我們有辦法延續你的生命。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "霜星",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "霜星",
      "text": "怎麼一副......憐憫他人的樣子？誰需要你們的憐憫？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "煌",
      "text": "怎麼，我看起來像是在可憐你？你挺強的，我是看得起你。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "霜星",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "霜星",
      "text": "憑什麼讓你們逃走？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "霜星",
      "text": "咳......咳咳......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "煌",
      "text": "Dr.{@nickname}，快走，別看她了！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "隕星",
      "text": "有整合運動在外圍廢墟向我們移動！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "霜星",
      "text": "別想走。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雪怪小隊成員",
      "text": "大姊，你現在站的那個位置！別用那個！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "霜星",
      "text": "不可以放他們走！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "霜星",
      "text": "羅德島會對龍門的同胞做什麼，誰也不知道！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "霜星",
      "text": "溫差升高，結構，脆化！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "霜星",
      "text": "咳，咳......凍結！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "霜星",
      "text": "......♪......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "霜星",
      "text": "咳......！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雪怪小隊成員",
      "text": "起作用了......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雪怪小隊成員",
      "text": "我們埋設的源石改變了下層結構，地塊已經開始傾斜了！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雪怪小隊成員",
      "text": "大姊，你那個位置太危險了，快抱住我！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "霜星",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雪怪小隊成員",
      "text": "大姊？！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "隕星",
      "text": "......煌，聽見沒？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "煌",
      "text": "啊？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "隕星",
      "text": "這是建築物的碎裂聲？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "煌",
      "text": "啊......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米婭",
      "text": "埋設源石，吸熱，溫差......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米婭",
      "text": "斷裂的建築牆體，難道......霜星的法術，也可以這樣發揮作用嗎......？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "煌",
      "text": "不好！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "煌",
      "text": "這塊地塊在變形！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "隕星",
      "text": "整合運動還能做到這種事？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "煌",
      "text": "說不清，但......整片區域在下沉！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米婭",
      "text": "快走！去穩固的區域待著，這裡的地塊要沉陷了！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "潔西卡",
      "text": "......博士？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "潔西卡",
      "text": "博士，你腳下......開裂了？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "煌",
      "text": "完蛋。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "煌",
      "text": "Dr.{@nickname}！跳過來！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "跳什麼......",
          "value": "1",
          "blocks": []
        }
      ],
      "sharedBlocks": [
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "阿米婭",
          "text": "博士！",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "煌",
          "text": "阿米婭，別去！Dr.{@nickname}，先抓住那根電線杆！",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "阿米婭",
          "text": "先救博士！",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "煌",
          "text": "地面撕裂傾斜的速度太快了，我勾不到！",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "阿米婭",
          "text": "那我去！！",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "煌",
          "text": "不行！",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "阿米婭",
          "text": "你說什麼——",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "......沒事的。",
          "value": "1",
          "blocks": []
        }
      ],
      "sharedBlocks": [
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "阿米婭",
          "text": "博士！！",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "隕星",
          "text": "周圍的建築物承受不了自重，正在墜落！",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "煌",
          "text": "隕星，接好！",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "隕星",
          "text": "好，我帶阿米婭走！",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "阿米婭",
          "text": "放手！",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "煌",
          "text": "阿米婭，你走，我來幫博士！相信我作為羅德島幹員的實力！",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "阿米婭",
          "text": "......",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "煌",
          "text": "嘁，看來還是要流點血。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "煌",
          "text": "博士，我會用氣流和真空壓減緩你的墜落速度，撐開你身邊的建築，放心，它們壓不到你！",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "煌",
          "text": "不要怕！千萬不要怕！",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "煌",
          "text": "......一會兒見！",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "一會兒見。",
          "value": "1",
          "blocks": []
        }
      ],
      "sharedBlocks": [
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "煌",
          "text": "......",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "雪怪小隊成員",
          "text": "......",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "煌",
          "text": "怎麼？霜星呢？",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "煌",
          "text": "......你們的指揮官也掉下去了？",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "雪怪小隊成員",
          "text": "......是啊。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "雪怪小隊成員",
          "text": "要嘛我們別打了吧？",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "雪怪小隊成員",
          "text": "羅德島的兔子，我們暫時休戰怎麼樣？其實我們一開始也不太想和你們打。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "阿米婭",
          "text": "可是各位......",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "雪怪小隊成員",
          "text": "梅菲斯特告知大姊，說你殺了亞歷克斯，所以大姊非常擔憂你們接下來的行動。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "阿米婭",
          "text": "......亞歷克斯是？",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "雪怪小隊成員",
          "text": "碎骨。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "阿米婭",
          "text": "很抱歉。碎骨確實是被我殺害的。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "雪怪小隊成員",
          "text": "......哎。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "阿米婭",
          "text": "感染者本來不該相互為敵的。很抱歉。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "雪怪小隊成員",
          "text": "有什麼好道歉的？你們當時在交戰吧？",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "阿米婭",
          "text": "是。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "雪怪小隊成員",
          "text": "那我們停火吧。大熊，你怎麼說？",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "雪怪小隊成員",
          "text": "啊？*烏薩斯粗口*！",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "雪怪小隊成員",
          "text": "大熊說他也沒問題。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "霜葉",
          "text": "我覺得他不是這麼說的。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "雪怪小隊成員",
          "text": "只要不在交戰狀態，就沒理由再讓誰去殺誰了吧？",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "阿米婭",
          "text": "為什麼你......會想要停戰？",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "雪怪小隊成員",
          "text": "你看，我們兩邊領袖都是兔子。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "煌",
          "text": "......啊？",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "霜葉",
          "text": "我腦海裡似乎有什麼東西崩潰了。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "潔西卡",
          "text": "啊？",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "霜葉",
          "text": "凍原的雪怪居然是這樣的人。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "潔西卡",
          "text": "什，什麼？",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "霜葉",
          "text": "他們不應該冷血無情，冰塊一樣嗎。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "霜葉",
          "text": "我不能接受。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "雪怪小隊成員",
          "text": "......那是偏見。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "雪怪小隊成員",
          "text": "小兔子，聽我說。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "雪怪小隊成員",
          "text": "戰鬥的勝負，你們究竟去哪，我們都不關心。我們更在乎大姊的命。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "雪怪小隊成員",
          "text": "你們也在關注隊友的安危，不是嗎？",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "阿米婭",
          "text": "......是的。我們不是為了傷害誰才深入廢城的。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "雪怪小隊成員",
          "text": "至少，你們不是來搞什麼“整合運動感染者大獵殺”的，對不對？",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "阿米婭",
          "text": "肯定不。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "雪怪小隊成員",
          "text": "我們倒......不太能否認這個事情。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "雪怪小隊成員",
